---
// Footer.astro - Minimal Aesthetic Edition
---

<footer class="mt-14 border-t border-red-500/20 bg-[#030102]/95 py-6 px-4 pb-16 sm:pb-6 text-center">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xs text-[#9CA3AF]">
    <!-- Minimal Clean Copyright & Ecosystem -->
    <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 flex-wrap justify-center sm:justify-start">
      <span class="text-white font-semibold">© 2026 CleanPhoto</span>
      <span>•</span>
      <span>Built for <a href="https://cleanphoto.fixeehub.com" class="text-red-400 hover:text-red-300 font-medium">FixeeHub Ecosystem</a></span>
    </div>

    <!-- Official Contact Link -->
    <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
      <span>Contact:</span>
      <a 
        href="mailto:contactfixeehub@gmail.com" 
        class="text-red-300 hover:text-white font-mono transition-colors"
      >
        contactfixeehub@gmail.com
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
